/*
  DashboardSettingsModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal / dialog · 0022 · DashboardSettingsModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native `DashboardSettingsModal`
  resolves (table "DashboardSettingsModal") lives here with its English value. The web source
  (features/dashboard/components/DashboardSettingsModal.tsx) routes its copy through
  `t('dashSettings…')` / `t('common…')`; the native surface mirrors those keys so no English literal
  lives in Swift. These entries fold into the app `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration
  time; they are kept in a per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings
  without editing the shared catalog.

  Groups: dialog chrome + states; the freshness chip + banners; the Identity section; the Vehicle
  Filter section; the Auto-Refresh section + the 6 cadence labels (web `REFRESH_OPTIONS`); the Display
  section; and the shared footer actions.
*/

